{"unit_id":"dakeshui123__dsh-pet-frieren#card-zh","repo":"dakeshui123/dsh-pet-frieren","commit":"6ae4ed4b194f4335bbf573d65bb864a7e3416344","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Frieren 芙莉莲是一款面向 DeepSeek Harness Web GUI 的桌面宠物插件。它将一个可拖动的动画角色叠加在网页界面上，并根据当前会话状态切换待机、思考、工具执行、输出、等待确认、计划审阅和错误动画。用户可以点击挥手、双击跳跃、拖动并记住位置，也能隐藏后通过徽章恢复；状态变化时会显示短语气泡。插件通过 DSH 的 webServer 提供本地精灵图资源，浏览器端读取 sessions 状态并在页面绘制。适合希望在 Web 会话中获得可视状态提示和桌面宠物互动的用户；无需额外 API key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48","lib/client.js:24","lib/client.js:106","lib/client.js:440"]}
{"unit_id":"dakeshui123__dsh-pet-frieren#card-en","repo":"dakeshui123/dsh-pet-frieren","commit":"6ae4ed4b194f4335bbf573d65bb864a7e3416344","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Frieren is an animated pet for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI. It reflects thinking, tool calls, output, approval, plan review, and errors. Users can drag it, wave, jump, or hide and restore it. The browser reads session state; a local route serves sprites. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48","lib/client.js:24","lib/client.js:106","lib/client.js:440"]}
